[en.FOCUS_C12_RELOCATE_CAPITAL_TO_THE_CASTLE]
New Castle Owner

[en.FOCUS_C12_RELOCATE_CAPITAL_TO_THE_CASTLE_desc]
As the Apple Pie family is completely unified, this great new country needs a better capital than Appleloosa and Rock Farm to reign impartially over every region. The castle left by the Princesses has become the best choice. It will be quickly renovated to welcome their ruler from the Apple Pie family.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_RELOCATE_CAPITAL_TO_THE_CASTLE]
古堡新主

[zh.FOCUS_C12_RELOCATE_CAPITAL_TO_THE_CASTLE_desc]
自苹果派家族彻底统一后，这个伟大的新国家需要一个比苹果鲁萨和采石农场更好的首都来不偏袒的统治每一个地区 —— 曾经天角兽公主留下的城堡成为了最好的选择。这里将被迅速整修以迎接苹果派家族的统治。

